cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the paper given under
  preferred-citation.
type: software
title: >-
  Replication code for "Policy-Tree Descendant Algorithm for Solving
  Consumption–Saving Problems with a Safety Net"
abstract: >-
  Julia package Ptd: the policy-tree descendant (PTD) algorithm for
  life-cycle consumption–saving problems with a consumption floor, its
  stochastic variants PTD-SCEQ and PTD-OSA, the DC-EGM and G2EGM
  comparators, and the scripts and saved results behind the paper's
  tables and figures.
authors:
